9856ba5915aec141bac1fc6171bdd8e49","definition":{"id":"RB030","languages":["ruby"],"title":"Обход HTML-экранирования Rails","description":"html_safe или raw передаёт строку в HTML без штатного экранирования.","severity":"high","cwe":"CWE-79","owasp":"A03:2021","confidence":"medium","pattern":"\\.html_safe\\b|\\braw\\s*\\(","patternFlags":"","exclude":null,"excludeFlags":null,"scope":"line","category":"xss","recommendation":"Сохраняйте экранирование Rails; очищайте необходимый HTML через sanitize.","references":["https://cwe.mitre.org/data/definitions/79.html"]}},{"ruleId":"RB031","contentHash":"e3ff612680ca6a026899dcfa408e76145ea6b2ab5c0865d5dc5f674376d9fb0c","definition":{"id":"RB031","languages":["ruby"],"title":"Массовое присваивание всех параметров Rails","description":"permit! разрешает все поля пользовательского запроса.","severity":"high","cwe":"CWE-915","owasp":"A01:2021","confidence":"medium","pattern":"\\bparams(?:\\.[A-Za-z_]\\w*\\([^\\n)]*\\)|\\[[^\\]\\n]+\\])?\\.permit!","patternFlags":"","exclude":null,"excludeFlags":null,"scope":"line","category":"authorization","recommendation":"Используйте permit с явным списком редактируемых полей и отдельно проверяйте права.","references":["https://cwe.mitre.org/data/definitions/915.html"]}},{"ruleId":"RB032","contentHash":"09d65b63355f4a0601f4d36f1328fede23a0ad7da27900d3026789d4fb2858e1","definition":{"id":"RB032","languages":["ruby"],"title":"Отключена CSRF-защита Rails","description":"Контроллер отключает verify_authenticity_token.","severity":"medium","cwe":"CWE-352","owasp":"A01:2021","confidence":"medium","pattern":"\\bskip_before_action\\b[^\\n]*\\bverify_authenticity_token\\b|\\bskip_forgery_protection\\b","patternFlags":"","exclude":null,"excludeFlags":null,"scope":"line","category":"csrf","recommendation":"Сохраните protect_from_forgery для сессий; исключения ограничьте API с независимой аутентификацией.","references":["https://cwe.mitre.org/data/definitions/352.html"]}},{"ruleId":"RB033","contentHash":"c65e12d9a25eef4744fefbc60d2f8a57205eb8655e16310e02bc2096eadfce28","definition":{"id":"RB033","languages":["ruby"],"title":"Ruby OpenSSL не проверяет сертификат","description":"SSL-клиент использует VERIFY_NONE.","severity":"high","cwe":"CWE-295","owasp":"A02:2021","confidence":"high","pattern":"\\bverify_mode\\s*=\\s*OpenSSL::SSL::VERIFY_NONE\\b","patternFlags":"","exclude":null,"excludeFlags":null,"scope":"line","category":"transport","recommendation":"Используйте VERIFY_PEER, доверенные CA и проверку имени сервера.","references":["https://cwe.mitre.org/data/definitions/295.html"]}},{"ruleId":"RS030","contentHash":"dd8a03aadd1161ac8c33948017ee4a16a546b4c12516cfa3b13df427c6402dfb","definition":{"id":"RS030","languages":["rust"],"title":"Rust OpenSSL не проверяет сертификат","description":"TLS builder использует SslVerifyMode::NONE.","severity":"high","cwe":"CWE-295","owasp":"A02:2021","confidence":"high","pattern":"\\.set_verify\\s*\\(\\s*(?:openssl::ssl::)?SslVerifyMode::NONE\\s*\\)","patternFlags":"","exclude":null,"excludeFlags":null,"scope":"line","category":"transport","recommendation":"Используйте SslVerifyMode::PEER и проверку имени сервера.","references":["https://cwe.mitre.org/data/definitions/295.html"]}},{"ruleId":"RS031","contentHash":"79dbc7a73c59de4d2a23d296a43b2e4987fcd07a6b4d933af84cd2b1051817d7","definition":{"id":"RS031","languages":["rust"],"title":"Небезопасный SHA-1 в Rust","description":"Используется SHA-1, который не обеспечивает стойкость к коллизиям.","severity":"medium","cwe":"CWE-327","owasp":"A02:2021","confidence":"medium","pattern":"\\b(?:sha1::)?Sha1::(?:new|digest)\\s*\\(","patternFlags":"","exclude":null,"excludeFlags":null,"scope":"line","category":"crypto","recommendation":"Используйте SHA-256/512 для целостности; для паролей — Argon2id.","references":["https://cwe.mitre.org/data/definitions/327.html"]}},{"ruleId":"RS032","contentHash":"93948c72c0881eed760f7b003bce4846e5b09626326b5706d333a32558dfbe0d","definition":{"id":"RS032","languages":["rust"],"title":"SQL-инъекция rusqlite","description":"query_row/prepare получает SQL из format!.","severity":"critical","cwe":"CWE-89","owasp":"A03:2021","confidence":"medium","pattern":"\\.(?:query_row|prepare)\\s*\\(\\s*&?format!\\s*\\(","patternFlags":"","exclude":null,"excludeFlags":null,"scope":"line","category":"injection","recommendation":"Используйте статический SQL и параметры rusqlite params!.","references":["https://cwe.mitre.org/data/definitions/89.html"]}},{"ruleId":"RS033","contentHash":"04f48109610b79ffd9cb69b5b738c8eaa69e5ff3fcb53b4f6df194a2699c91c0","definition":{"id":"RS033","languages":["rust"],"title":"Rust создаёт общедоступный файл","description":"OpenOptionsExt явно задаёт режим 0777 или 0666.","severity":"high","cwe":"CWE-732","owasp":"A05:2021","confidence":"medium","pattern":"\\.mode\\s*\\(\\s*0o(?:777|666)\\s*\\)","patternFlags":"","exclude":null,"excludeFlags":null,"scope":"line","category":"configuration","recommendation":"Задайте минимальные права, например 0o600 для чувствительных файлов.","references":["https://cwe.mitre.org/data/definitions/732.html"]}},{"ruleId":"SWIFT030","contentHash":"0932fbf84abe297c07c4cdcee576fdcb2dff00e548ee39c08a66fe85715b0f1d","definition":{"id":"SWIFT030","languages":["swift"],"title":"Keychain доступен при блокировке","description":"Выбран устаревший уровень Keychain AccessibleAlways.","severity":"high","cwe":"CWE-922","owasp":"A05:2021","confidence":"medium","pattern":"\\bkSecAttrAccessibleAlways(?:ThisDeviceOnly)?\\b","patternFlags":"","exclude":null,"excludeFlags":null,"scope":"line","category":"configuration","recommendation":"Используйте kSecAttrAccessibleWhenUnlocked или более строгий уровень с учётом фонового доступа.","references":["https://cwe.mitre.org/data/definitions/922.html"]}},{"ruleId":"SWIFT031","contentHash":"c44f88b7094fe92c60c445e8ee958820c9b52503861a2cd61af805b53d6894aa","definition":{"id":"SWIFT031","languages":["swift"],"title":"ECB в CommonCrypto","description":"CommonCr