рки защиты credentials, сессий или аутентификации.","severity":"high","cwe":"CWE-306","owasp":"A07:2021","confidence":"medium","pattern":"^\\s*protected-mode\\s*(?:[:=]\\s*)?no\\b","patternFlags":"im","exclude":null,"excludeFlags":null,"scope":"line","category":"authentication","recommendation":"Включите protected-mode и настройте ACL, bind и TLS.","references":["https://cwe.mitre.org/data/definitions/306.html"]}},{"ruleId":"CFG119","contentHash":"8c05c6ddf1817b25d0ae07ca836b99905c0cf54df41fea26b6b1777a44448480","definition":{"id":"CFG119","languages":["config"],"title":"MySQL запускается без grants","description":"MySQL запускается без grants. Настройка требует проверки защиты credentials, сессий или аутентификации.","severity":"high","cwe":"CWE-306","owasp":"A07:2021","confidence":"medium","pattern":"^\\s*(?:--)?skip-grant-tables(?:\\s|=|$)","patternFlags":"im","exclude":null,"excludeFlags":null,"scope":"line","category":"authentication","recommendation":"Удалите skip-grant-tables из production-конфигурации.","references":["https://cwe.mitre.org/data/definitions/306.html"]}},{"ruleId":"CFG120","contentHash":"80eebe52a536e1a706d5a7fd99b88f844320307c68de563d0456bfeec25d1680","definition":{"id":"CFG120","languages":["config"],"title":"Nginx не проверяет upstream TLS","description":"Nginx не проверяет upstream TLS. Настройка ослабляет защиту соединения. Проверьте протокол и аутентификацию другой стороны.","severity":"high","cwe":"CWE-295","owasp":"A02:2021","confidence":"medium","pattern":"\\bproxy_ssl_verify\\s+off\\s*;","patternFlags":"i","exclude":null,"excludeFlags":null,"scope":"line","category":"transport","recommendation":"Включите proxy_ssl_verify и настройте trusted CA/hostname upstream.","references":["https://cwe.mitre.org/data/definitions/295.html"]}},{"ruleId":"CFG121","contentHash":"77b306359958f705c72a5a21db49b09c08ac29181135950ee8ff023666263bad","definition":{"id":"CFG121","languages":["config"],"title":"HAProxy не проверяет backend TLS","description":